# example preset file
# order of all values is RGB, comma-separated
# this example preset is based off a roll of 2026 Eastman Kodak Kodacolor 100
# newlines are ignored, but order of adjustments is always the same:
#     black_adjust;gray_adjust;white_adjust;custom_adjust
# the last line does not need a semicolon, it is used only as a separator

# black adjust
0.3847257196903229,0.2238193303346634,0.13138018548488617;
# gray adjust
0.1701849951003388,0.143763470717083,0.19195623503637563;
# white adjust
1.3648128510932116,1.1430813231166987,1.0;
# custom adjust
1.0,1.0,1.03
